DESCRIPTION:The Pickled Pickers LIVE at AJ’s Grayton Beach on the main st
 age from 5:00pm til 8:00pm. This local band keeps the energy high perfor
 ming a mix of southern rock\, blues\, R&B\, country\, bluegrass\, and “
